): cat thang hetTu -> khung 0 clip sau, hoac tron cheo KET THUC dung tai hetTu (bat dau tai hetTu+1-so khung tron), khong bao gio bat dau tron tu hetTu. Neu khung = hetTu+1 (mp4 da cat duoi) thi het video chinh la hetTu, chuyen canh theo duration nhu clip thuong.","hetTu":346}